{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地花旦趙露思自2024年底在拍攝劇集《戀人》期間因抑鬱症復發而停拍後，相隔近2年再次拍攝新劇《告別信》，該劇由她出資購買版權並參與投資。</p><p>《告別信》昨日（12日）於成都開機，幕後班底全面曝光，原來趙露思除了主演及投資外，她還兼任總導演及造型</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T01:23:55.726446+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:01:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T01:17:13.771476+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T01:17:13.771476+00:00","content_hash":"d9f1405ec0c0a487b80ba306d13278ff7f251ff1689aa8704507380bd9884f82","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}